  "code" : "public int eraseOverlapIntervals(int[][] intervals) {\n    Arrays.sort(intervals, Comparator.comparingInt(a -> a[1]));\n    int removals = 0, lastEnd = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n    for (int[] interval : intervals) {\n        if (interval[0] >= lastEnd) {\n            lastEnd = interval[1];\n        } else {\n            removals++;\n        }\n    }\n    return removals;\n}",
